TH_0023> which sends <MATH_0024> to\n<MATH_0025>\nWe omit the verification that <MATH_0026> and <MATH_0027> are quasi-inverse.\nWe also do not address functoriality of <MATH_0028> (because it would\nlead into 3-category territory which we want to avoid at all cost).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:785968f6e8c4a02132e8d8b3d82939fdbd869c4a757ae94423f82cd52da2a1b8", "unit_id": "tag:06HA:statement"}
