rical sense: the same construction as in\nRemark <REF_0003> defines a functorial\nbijection\n<MATH_0008>\nfor <MATH_0009> and\n<MATH_0010>.\nAgain the map <MATH_0011> is an\nisomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:11bacdfe9b9f90c7653222b941f60cad9c68130cc09abb56873efe330bf8b406", "unit_id": "tag:06HB:statement"}
